# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599, Preacher selected at (44,22)). No unit/state is touched.
# CHEAT menu unlock = Alt-W, Alt-I, Alt-N in succession (spells WIN), Alt-W alone turns it off (COLONIZE/README.TXT).
# Hidden CHEAT title: Alt-C (shared hotkey letter) opens the COLONIZOPEDIA menu instead; a broken sequence (Alt-W, Alt-N) leaves it hidden.
# DOS also toggles head.game_options.cheats_enabled (DS:0x5383 bit5) with it; the test ends with the menu off so the save is unchanged either way.
key c alt                # CHEAT hidden: Alt-C opens the COLONIZOPEDIA menu
shot
key Escape               # closes the menu only
key w alt
key n alt                # wrong sequence (Alt-I skipped): still hidden
key c alt
shot
key Escape
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt                # unlocked: "CHEAT" appears on the menu bar
shot
key c alt                # Alt-C opens the CHEAT menu
shot
key Escape               # closes the menu only
key F1 shift             # Shift-F1 = Create Unit list
shot
key Escape               # cancel the list, nothing created
key w alt                # Alt-W: cheat mode off, CHEAT title gone
key c alt                # hidden again: COLONIZOPEDIA menu
shot
key Escape
